Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix: stop using Clutter.get_default_backend()
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Gone in GNOME 51 (mutter !4981). Use the stage backend instead.
Same change as rmader in #632.

Co-authored-by: Robert Mader <robert.mader@collabora.com>
